  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.AvalancheOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to Avalanche -- high-performance blockchain delivering sub-second finality, EVM compatibility on the C-Chain, and unlimited scalability via custom subnets. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and tokens. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Add native CQL balance profiles for Base Avalanche and BNB Chain (e4da3c4)\n- Fix Avalanche encryption chain identity and verify CQL Mongo demo MVP (6a52956)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.AvalancheOASIS",
